{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "97", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "That ends the proceedings for this game. The 3rd and final T20I will be played at the same venue on 22nd June at 1630 IST. India will aim to maintain the momentum while Zimbabwe will look to deliver a better performance. Do join us then. Goodbye and take care!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "96", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Man of the Match, Barinder Sran says that he had a lot of fun bowling today. Didn't feel that he was under a lot of pressure even though it was his T20I debut. Adds that he didn't focus much on the pace as the ball was swinging.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "95", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Victorious Indian captain, MS Dhoni agrees that it's a big victory but the bowlers started it all. He feels that it was a pitch with variable bounce. Is happy with the intensity on the field and the running between the wickets. Stresses that in the shorter format, it is very important to run the twos and the threes.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "94", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Zimbabwean captain, Graeme Cremer says that they started a bit slowly and lost wickets at crucial times. Feels that it was a bit disappointing to make 99 and he thought the pitch misbehaved a bit. He is still excited for the final match and expects it to be a close one.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "93", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "It might have been a straightforward win for the visitors, but it was also aided by a string of failures on the part of the home side. The batsmen were unable to withstand the bowling attack and put up a disappointing total. In addition to this, they were ineffective with the ball and listless on the field. They'll have to come up with a much better performance in the third and final T20I.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "92", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "A comprehensive win for India, the first time that they have won a T20I by a 10-wicket margin. Openers Rahul and Mandeep chased down the 100-run target without much fuss. With nearly identical batting performances, the duo made it on their own steam in an easy 13.1 overs. However, Mandeep Singh got lucky when he was dropped twice while Rahul was fluent.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.1", "Id": "91", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57115", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "FOUR! Up and over! Short and wide outside off, 110 kph, Mandeep latches onto the bounce and crashes it over point for the winning boundary! That also brings up Mandeep's maiden T20I Fifty. INDIA WIN BY 10 WICKETS AND 41 BALLS TO SPARE!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "90", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "NEVILLE MADZIVA to bowl what should definitely be the final over of the match.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.6", "Id": "89", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "21561", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Landed outside off, steered to third man for a single. Mandeep moves to 48.", "Summary": {"Score": "99/0", "Over": "13", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10114", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "48", "Balls": "39", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "60122", "Runs": "47", "Balls": "40", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "2"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "21561", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.5", "Id": "88", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "21561", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Full on middle, 117.3 kph, pushed towards mid on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.4", "Id": "87", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "21561", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "FOUR! Cracking shot. Fractionally short in length outside off, 123.8 kph, Mandeep gets on top of the bounce and cuts it through point for a boundary!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.3", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "21561", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, 115.2 kph, watchfully defended with a lunge.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.2", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "21561", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Slightly short outside off, 112.6 kph, cut behind point for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.1", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "21561", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "A slower bouncer down the leg side, Rahul lets it go, thinking it will be wided but it isn't. Tight call.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "DONALD TIRIPANO to bowl, perhaps the final over of the match.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.6", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "FOUR! Lovely shot. Full and outside off, 78.6 kph, Mandeep leans and drives it through the covers. The fielder gets to his left to stop, slides but the ball goes through.", "Summary": {"Score": "93/0", "Over": "12", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10114", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "43", "Balls": "35", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "60122", "Runs": "46", "Balls": "38", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "2"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "25422", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Another short ball, pulled through square leg for a couple more.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.4", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Good fielding. A touch short outside off, 70.6 kph, Singh goes back and lofts it beautifully over extra cover. The fielder runs to his left from long off and pulls the ball back in, parrying it to the man from deep cover. Tw runs taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Tossed up slowly outside off, 79.5 kph, Mandeep lunges to dead-bat it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "On middle, 86.2 kph, worked through mid-wicket for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "25422", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Full on middle and leg, 83.3 kph, Rahul pushes this a tad uppishly to the bowler who dives to his right to stop it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "SIKANDAR RAZA to bowl now.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "A slower ball, 73.8 kph, down the leg side, worked behind square leg for another single. 10 from the over, 23 off the last 2!", "Summary": {"Score": "84/0", "Over": "11", "Runs": "10", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "60122", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "45", "Balls": "36", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "10114", "Runs": "35", "Balls": "31", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3656", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "24", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "The googly, around off, coming in, 82.5 kph, Mandeep fails to read it and somehow punches it through point for one.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Comes down the track and flicks this 85.8 kph ball through long on for a run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Flatter around leg, 83.3 kph, watchfully defended.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "A new box of balls comes out.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "SIX! Whoosh! On the roof! Rahul is in a hurry to finish this off. Flighted on middle and off, spinning away, Rahul comes down the track and lofts it dead straight. It hits the roof and goes out of the ground!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Tossed up outside leg, 82 kph, pushed towards square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Length ball outside off, pushed to the cover region for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "74/0", "Over": "10", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10114", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "33", "Balls": "29", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "60122", "Runs": "37", "Balls": "32", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3713", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "23", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Full on middle and off, Rahul drives it to mid on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "SIX! Full outside off, Rahul reaches out and lofts it over point for a biggie! The umpire raises his arms in the air to signal a six.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "FREE HIT coming up...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "nb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Short outside off, Rahul gets on the front foot and drives it to mid off. over steps and the umpire calls a no ball. Free Hit!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Length ball outside off, punched off the back foot through the covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "The batsman shows the full face of the bat and defends the ball off the back foot. The batsmen have run through for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, driven through mid off for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, pushed defensively.", "Summary": {"Score": "61/0", "Over": "9", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10114", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "30", "Balls": "26", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "60122", "Runs": "28", "Balls": "28", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3656", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "The batsman has played it towards mid-wicket.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "WIDE. This is down the leg side, Rahul misses his flick and the keeper Moor fumbles as well. A single taken, overall two to the total.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Floated on middle, pushed through to long on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Full outside off, driven through the covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Outside off, driven towards the mid off region for a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3656", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Short outside off, pushed to the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Full on off, driven through mid off for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "55/0", "Over": "8", "Runs": "10", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "60122", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "25", "Balls": "25", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "10114", "Runs": "29", "Balls": "23", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3713", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "10", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Length ball outside off, pushed to point for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "DROPPED! SIX! Poor effort. Dropped short around off, Mandeep pulls it straight to deep square leg. Tiripano runs back a touch for the catch but misjudges it and parries it beyond the ropes! Not Zimbabwe's day.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Fuller length this time, outside off, 104.9 kph, pushed straight to point.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "60122", "Commentary": "Down the leg side, worked through square leg for a run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3713", "Batsman": "10114", "Commentary": "Outside off, angling in, 114.9 kph, flicked through mid-wicket for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "CHAMU CHIBHABHA to bowl now.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowle